      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIDYALOUSAROOSTA (5) is racing in tremendous fashion with two wins and two minor placings from the past four outings. Finished win at Hobart two starts back then did a great job again at his latest appearance over 1680m at at this track, beaten a neck into second after being up on the pace from the outset. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. MUZZAME MATE (2) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 8 metres from the winner in fourth over 1609m at Hobart. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a comparable field and he is a strong winning hope. PREPARATION (1) ended last prep with a tenth at this track over 2200m 11 weeks ago. Can open this campaign with a more positive effort. CENTURIAN MISS (4) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by a neck at this track over 1680m.",
